        "id": 221004,
        "name": "dclietz",
        "username": "dclietz",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/3ec8ea/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-08-07T18:09:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This card was heavily discussed during playtesting and was polarizing. I admit I wanted it to work a bit differently, especially because I was worried that people wouldn't pick up on this interaction and conclude La Comadora was a bad hero because they couldn't get enough cards.&nbsp;<span>However, I don't think it is that bad to have 1 hero have the ability to switch up the phase order, it can be very interesting and fun at times.&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:53:35.685Z",
