        "raw": "<p>This card was heavily discussed during playtesting and was polarizing. I admit I wanted it to work a bit differently, especially because I was worried that people wouldn&#39;t pick up on this interaction and conclude La Comadora was a bad hero because they couldn&#39;t get enough cards.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">However, I don&#39;t think it is that bad to have 1 hero have the ability to switch up the phase order, it can be very interesting and fun at times.&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p>",
