        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/robertmaxfreeman/{size}/2147_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-08-07T20:37:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It's a neat trick, and I wouldn't consider it overpowered because it's equipment, so you'd have to play it a turn ahead of gaining this advantage, and it's also only 3 cards in her entire deck, with no way for her to search her deck for specific cards. It's handy, but a few extra cards over the course of a game is hardly game breaking.</p>",
